{
  "helpId": "pay.employee-sub-group-fund.edit",
  "lang": "en",
  "title": "Employee Sub Group Funds — Create / Edit",
  "entity": "HCMv3.PayrollManagement.EmployeeSubGroupFund",
  "overviewHtml": "<p>One pay band of the grade's fund deduction — for example a savings or provident fund. The employee's pay for the fund is the monthly total of wagetypes marked <em>Include In Fund</em>; the band whose From–To range holds that total sets the deduction.</p><p>The deduction is made only for employees enrolled in a fund, and not while they have a fund exemption or after their last day in service.</p>",
  "aliasIndex": {
    "loc:FromPay": "EmployeeSubGroupFund.FromPay",
    "dom:EmployeeSubGroupFund_FromPay": "EmployeeSubGroupFund.FromPay",
    "loc:ToPay": "EmployeeSubGroupFund.ToPay",
    "dom:EmployeeSubGroupFund_ToPay": "EmployeeSubGroupFund.ToPay",
    "loc:FundDedType": "EmployeeSubGroupFund.FundDedType",
    "dom:EmployeeSubGroupFund_FundDedType": "EmployeeSubGroupFund.FundDedType",
    "loc:Percentage": "EmployeeSubGroupFund.Percentage",
    "dom:EmployeeSubGroupFund_Percentage": "EmployeeSubGroupFund.Percentage",
    "loc:MinAmount": "EmployeeSubGroupFund.MinAmount",
    "dom:EmployeeSubGroupFund_MinAmount": "EmployeeSubGroupFund.MinAmount",
    "loc:MaxAmount": "EmployeeSubGroupFund.MaxAmount",
    "dom:EmployeeSubGroupFund_MaxAmount": "EmployeeSubGroupFund.MaxAmount",
    "loc:FixAmount": "EmployeeSubGroupFund.FixAmount",
    "dom:EmployeeSubGroupFund_FixAmount": "EmployeeSubGroupFund.FixAmount"
  },
  "fields": [
    {
      "id": "EmployeeSubGroupFund.FromPay",
      "label": "FromPay",
      "section": "EmployeeSubGroupFunds",
      "aliases": [
        "loc:FromPay",
        "dom:EmployeeSubGroupFund_FromPay"
      ],
      "rules": "Optional. Number.",
      "when": null,
      "html": "<p><strong>What it is.</strong> The lowest pay in this band.</p><p><strong>Example.</strong> <code>0</code></p><p><strong>Why it matters.</strong> From cannot be greater than To.</p>",
      "adminHtml": "",
      "stub": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EmployeeSubGroupFund.ToPay",
      "label": "ToPay",
      "section": "EmployeeSubGroupFunds",
      "aliases": [
        "loc:ToPay",
        "dom:EmployeeSubGroupFund_ToPay"
      ],
      "rules": "Optional. Number.",
      "when": null,
      "html": "<p><strong>What it is.</strong> The highest pay in this band.</p><p><strong>Example.</strong> <code>999</code></p>",
      "adminHtml": "",
      "stub": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EmployeeSubGroupFund.FundDedType",
      "label": "FundDedType",
      "section": "EmployeeSubGroupFunds",
      "aliases": [
        "loc:FundDedType",
        "dom:EmployeeSubGroupFund_FundDedType"
      ],
      "rules": "Required. One of: Percentage, PercentageWithinLimit, Fix Amount.",
      "when": null,
      "html": "<p><strong>What it is.</strong> How the deduction is worked out for this band.</p><p><strong>Example.</strong> Percentage</p><p><strong>Why it matters.</strong> <em>Fix Amount</em> deducts the fixed amount. <em>Percentage</em> deducts the percentage of the pay. <em>PercentageWithinLimit</em> deducts the percentage, but no more than the maximum and no less than the minimum. The result is rounded to 2 decimals.</p>",
      "adminHtml": "",
      "stub": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EmployeeSubGroupFund.Percentage",
      "label": "Percentage",
      "section": "EmployeeSubGroupFunds",
      "aliases": [
        "loc:Percentage",
        "dom:EmployeeSubGroupFund_Percentage"
      ],
      "rules": "Optional. Number.",
      "when": null,
      "html": "<p><strong>What it is.</strong> The percentage of pay deducted, for the two percentage types.</p><p><strong>Example.</strong> <code>5</code></p>",
      "adminHtml": "",
      "stub": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EmployeeSubGroupFund.MinAmount",
      "label": "MinAmount",
      "section": "EmployeeSubGroupFunds",
      "aliases": [
        "loc:MinAmount",
        "dom:EmployeeSubGroupFund_MinAmount"
      ],
      "rules": "Optional. Number.",
      "when": null,
      "html": "<p><strong>What it is.</strong> The least deducted, for <em>PercentageWithinLimit</em>.</p><p><strong>Example.</strong> <code>10</code></p>",
      "adminHtml": "",
      "stub": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EmployeeSubGroupFund.MaxAmount",
      "label": "MaxAmount",
      "section": "EmployeeSubGroupFunds",
      "aliases": [
        "loc:MaxAmount",
        "dom:EmployeeSubGroupFund_MaxAmount"
      ],
      "rules": "Optional. Number.",
      "when": null,
      "html": "<p><strong>What it is.</strong> The most deducted, for <em>PercentageWithinLimit</em>.</p><p><strong>Example.</strong> <code>100</code></p>",
      "adminHtml": "",
      "stub": false
    },
    {
